   00001| //! Natural-language skill compiler.
   00002| //!
   00003| //! The first compiler target is intentionally narrow and deterministic:
   00004| //! trigger/response prose such as `When I say "X", answer "Y"` lowers to a
   00005| //! reviewable associative package containing a trigger rule and compiled
   00006| //! response handler. The solver can replay that package from dialog history
   00007| //! and record the reuse as a `cache_hit`.
